      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mid terraced two bedroom red brick town house with attic conversion (approx. 95 sqm).\r\nTown centre setting within a few minutes’ walk of all town centre amenities including train and bus stations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor: \r\nLiving room: 4.54m x 3.7m; patio door to small enclosed west-facing terrace\r\nKitchen & Dining: 4.4m x 2.94m\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nBedroom 1: 4.45m x 2.06m\r\nBedroom 2: 4.355m x 2.73m\r\nBathroom: 1.95m x 1.63m (electric shower, wc & whb\r\n\r\nAttic Level:\r\nFitted open plan space: 6.9m x 4.46m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Floor finishes include tiles and varnished tongue & grooved plank flooring.\r\nAttractive open plan attic space providing additional living accommodation.\r\nOil fired central heating."
      },
